CHAPTER.VERS:
But this I say, brethren, the time [is] 

          For we are now in the latter end of the world.
         short: it remaineth, that both they that have wives be as though they had none;

And they that 

          By «weeping» the Hebrews understand all adversity, and by «joy», all prosperity.
         weep, as though they wept not; and they that rejoice, as though they rejoiced not; and they that buy, as though they possessed not;
